ooking a…"],["Hotel Star","restaurant",23.72091,90.41331,"Taher Bagh Lane","","","","","r","Does fantastic biryani and goat leg roast."],["Beauty laccha faluda","restaurant",23.72144,90.40578,"30, 1 Kazi Alauddin Road","","","","","r","Recommended by Wikivoyage"],["Baitul Mukarram Mosque","sight",23.72944,90.41222,"","","","","","r","The national mosque of Bangladesh. It was built in 1968, and is the 10th largest mosque in the world."],["Banga Bhaban","sight",23.7233,90.41782,"","","","","","r","Official residence of the President. This grand palace of the British India era is only visible from the outside."],["Musa Khan Mosque","sight",23.7268,90.4007,"University of Dhaka","","","","","r","Located west of Shahidullah Hall at Dhaka University, this historical mosque was built to honour the former ruler of the region. The inscriptions on the mosque seem to state that it was built in 1484 CE, but was repaired heavily in 1700 CE."],["Old High Court Building","sight",23.73076,90.40251,"Kazi Nazrul Islam Ave, Ramna","","","","","r","It was built as the residence of the British Governor, it illustrates a happy blend of European and Mughal architecture. Now houses the Supreme Court."],["Curzon Hall","sight",23.72735,90.40185,"University of Dhaka","","","","","r","An architecturally beautiful building named after Lord Curzon. Once intended as a town hall, it now houses the Science Faculty of the University of Dhaka."],["Ramna Green","sight",23.73818,90.40137,"Ramna","","","","","r","It is one of the largest parks in Dhaka, seen as the city's equivalent to Kolkata's Maidan and New York City's Central Park. This huge sprawling area was the site of Mughal gardens and tombs before becoming a public park and race course…"],["Shahbaz Khan Mosque and Dargah","sight",23.7293,90.40057,"Suhrawardy Uddyan, behind Mausoleum of Three Leaders","","","","","r","This mosque and tomb, constructed in 1679 by Haji khwaja Shahbaz, a rich merchant of Dhaka."],["New Café Jheel","restaurant",23.73016,90.40781,"18/1 Topkhana Road","","","","","r","Serves good local dishes for the budget traveler. Expect to pay Tk 150-200 for a 3 course meal. Although you can possibly get lunch/dinner for as low as Tk 60."]]}